Say which test targets can notice what changed since `njutest measure`

Usage: njutest select [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>
          How to say what was decided

          Possible values:
          - human:     Every target, whether it runs, and why
          - nextest:   A nextest filterset that leaves out every target proved unable to notice the
            change
          - skippable: The targets proved unable to notice the change, one per line
          
          [default: human]

      --offline
          Pass `--offline` to cargo

      --locked
          Pass `--locked` to cargo

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
